<title>USA: IMM CURRENCIES MIXED, KEY CONTRACTS BUILD ON GAINS.</title>
<headline>IMM CURRENCIES MIXED, KEY CONTRACTS BUILD ON GAINS.</headline>
<text>
<p>Aug 6 - IMM currencies were mixed early, as key contracts built on gains. Sept marks, Swiss and yen turned up early then made new session highs on dollar profit-taking. USTR Barshefsky says U.S. concerned with sharp drop in auto sales to Japan. Sept yen higher, still below Tuesday's $0.008525 high.</p>
<p>((Derivatives Desk(312)408-8750))</p>
